                  <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_c83c7e89">
                     <extent xml:id="extent_7bab0fe3">12 pages</extent>
                     <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_1f1aad97">27.5 x 38</dimensions>
                     <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_80a33c3e">Nos. 1 &amp; No. 2 stitched together. No. 1 written in brown ink, paper: 12 staves; No. 2 written in black and brown ink, paper: 16 staves. On p. 1 Hartmann has glued a piece of the same paper as No. 2 with the piano introduction on the original paper. In the upper right-hand corner he has written: "For Conservatoriet - Septbr: 1837", which indicates that the work has been written two years earlier for another purpose.</physMedium>
